#!info##A special worm template that allows you to compile your own Python code into an executable using Draconus compilers. You can switch the compiler to "Nuitka"; by default, PyInstaller is used. Open the file "OUTPUT/links/PyToExe", paste your code there, then create this template, change the compiler if desired, and compile it.
#!lang##python
#!Wprocess##BasicPy
#!wormCompiler##PyInstaller
